
[1m== The SPIRE proof of concept of TACRA: an attested workload on sev-snp[0m
In the words of the draft: the workload is the Attester, with the Credential Acquisition Interface built in.
SPIRE Agent is the CAS Client and SPIRE Server the CAS Server: conduits, holding no RATS role and no credential.
SPIRE Server's CA is the Credential Authority, the Relying Party for enrollment: it recomputes the binding value
and appraises the Attestation Results by its own policy; the conduit only forwards Evidence to the Verifier.
The bench's Secret Vault is the Relying Party for retrieval; the bench's Veraison is the Verifier.

